| `python3 -I scripts/03_analyze.py` | `results/{targets,primary,per_bench,ratio_by_n,ordering,pairwise,bias_by_score,ceiling}*` and `results/raw/target_level.parquet` |
| `TWO_PCT=1 python3 -I scripts/03_analyze.py results/raw_2pct results/twopct` | the same for n/N = 2 % |
