| `python3 -I scripts/14_bias_r100.py results/highR/per_bench.csv.gz results/per_bench.csv.gz results/highR_vs_main.csv results/raw_highR/target_level.parquet results/highR_target_bias.csv` | Table 3's bias²/variance/MSE at R = 10 and R = 100 side by side, and per-target bias against its Monte-Carlo standard error |
| `python3 -I scripts/11_extrap_bias.py results/raw/target_level.parquet results/extrap_bias.csv` | signed bias of the model-based estimators against the target's distance above the sources (extrapolation, n = 100): slope, bias of the top quarter, share of squared bias |
